# Every size, the .icns and the platform sets, all generated from
# src-tauri/icon.png by `pnpm icons`, which the build runs first. The source
# lives outside this directory because `tauri icon` writes icon.png into it,
# and a source that is also an output rewrites itself on every build.
src-tauri/icons/
